  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cybersecurity Rapid Response Measures for Albania, Montenegro, North Macedonia II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(251, 251, 251); color: rgb(83, 83, 83);&quot;&gt;This 18-month measure contributes to building up operational rapid cyber response capacity in Albania, Montenegro and North Macedonia in the short term. The goal is to empower the governments&#xbf; technical agencies to address the risks of cyber incidents, assess how these incidents impact networks of government entities or critical service providers, collect and share data across government to help understand and respond to attacks and thus limit their adverse impact. It also supports coordination with other agencies and cybersecurity for the democratic processes and institutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
